WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.300
Here is how Steady Path works, start to finish.

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:04.700
Start free.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.600
Answer a few questions about the work you want.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:11.450
It takes about fifteen minutes, and there is no card.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.550
Steady Path finds real openings near you,

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.400
and checks each one on the employer's own site, with the pay as posted.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:24.150
Say yes to a job, and you get a resume and cover letter written for it.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.600
Read them and ask for changes before anything is used.

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:31.900
You send every application yourself.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:36.150
Steady Path shows you where and how, step by step.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:41.000
Your portal keeps track of when to follow up, with the note already drafted.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:43.000
Got an interview?

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.000
Practice common questions and save your best stories.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:47.900
Got an offer?

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:50.250
Check it against the posted pay before you answer.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.700
Free for 14 days.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:56.750
Then $99 a month, only if you choose to continue.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:58.300
Ready when you are.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:01.500
Start free at steadypathcareers.com.
